1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
I realized I built my AI world backwards.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:09,000
I kept adding dialogue guards.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:15,000
But the real problem was a thin situation.

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:23,000
If nothing happens, the model has to fake movement from style.

5
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:31,000
v0.2 is not more prompts. It is making events real.

6
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:38,000
Speech should come from life, not from bans.
